	Another request:

	Could bag & chest manipulation be made more user friendly?
I'm sick of applying bags, and answering:
Do you wish to take something out of your bag? y
a food ration? n
a long sword? n
a potion of object detection? n
an elven dagger? n
..
..
..
50 more things, hence 50 more yes/no questions
..
a tin of acid blob ? y
(whew! I needed that!)

(invariably I here get "n" happy and answer n to the one thing I 
needed, and have to try again; meantime every monster gets another hit at
me and the concrete starts to set around my gills...

