and I am in the middle game hence are carrying enough to give even
Allied Van Lines a bit of trouble, it really is a pain to have to go
through item by item, answering n, until I can answer y to the items I
wish to stash in my bag or in a chest. Of course, here again, i
usually type n one too many times, and have to go through it again.

It really infuriates my wife, who is watching me, waiting for me to
die, so SHE can play, when I'm trying to hide all the junk weapons
from the Orcs & Kobolds by sticking the weapons in a chest, when I have
to go through my inventory 8 times to finaly get them all.

Couldn't bags & chests use the drop and pickup code?  

Give me a [menu] and I can move [my inventory faster]!!!


